                  "Maldorrians",
                  "Maldorr"
               ],
               "secondary_keys": [],
               "content": "Maldorr is a country far to the north, and is home to many different types of people and beasts alike. Maldorr is a dangerous place filled with dangerous creatures, vagabonds, and ruled by a tyrannical monarchy. The northen half of the country is in a perpetual state of Autumn, where most trees and vegetation is always dead and dry. The middle portion of the country is more lively with large forests and massive plains, and home to the capital city, Evermore. The southern part of the country is mostly marshland and extremely dense and mostly uncharted forest. Maldorrians is the name for the inhabitants of the country.",
