            {
               "name": "",
               "keys": [
                  "Everians",
                  "Evermore"
               ],
               "secondary_keys": [],
               "content": "Evermore is the capital of Maldorr, a stable and prosperous city on the surface, but this false sense of peace is ruthlessly maintained by the royal army. Dissent is not tolerated, and even small crimes such as thievery are often punished with brutality, Evermore only accepts humans and elves into the city, as the Queen believes all other races to be savage or lesser. Everians is the name for the people who live in the city. The city got its name when the first king of Maldorr founded it and told his men to build \"A city that will stand forevermore.\"\n\nEvermore is home to the University of Magi, Thieves Guild, Royal Family, and Imperial Army.",
