            {
               "name": "",
               "keys": [
                  "Deadlands",
                  "The Deadlands"
               ],
               "secondary_keys": [],
               "content": "The Deadlands is the northern part of Maldorr, a region in a perpetual state of Autumn. The trees and vegetation are always dead and dry, and the leaves are always shades of orange, red, and yellow. The Deadlands houses a small city called \"Autumn Fall\", a few villages, and some small demi-human tribes. \n\nThe Deadlands is home to the Black Talon mercenary group.\n\nCreatures inhabiting the Deadlands(Gremlins + Kobolds + Wraiths + Undead + Wyverns + Wolves + Dire Wolves + Ogres + Cyclops)\n\nThere is a tribe of Beastfolk within the Deadlands, and they often trade with the Black Talon and the local villages.\n\nThere is a single dragon located in the most northern part of the Deadlands, a Frost Dragon that will only attack those that come close.",
