               "keys": [
                  "Black Talon"
               ],
               "secondary_keys": [],
               "content": "The Black Talon is a mercenary group housed in the Deadlands of Maldorr. They are one of the largest and most renown mercenary groups in the country. Despite their reputation among the nobility, they are revered by many commoners. They mostly take jobs as monster slayers, though they have been known to offer protection to villages in exchange for food. They keep the roads safe from bandits free of charge, as safe roads means more trade and better business.",
