               "keys": [
                  "University of Magi",
                  "University",
                  "Magi"
               ],
               "secondary_keys": [],
               "content": "The University of Magi is located in the center of Evermore. It houses some of the most talented magic users in all Maldorr, and will allow anyone to take a trial to gain entry. Only those either gifted with magic are allowed to attend the university. The university is one of the few institutions in the kingdom that is completely neutral, and does not answer to the royal family, this is due to a several century old truce between an old Arch Mage and the first king of Maldorr that granted the Magi complete autonomy.",
