                  "Marshes",
                  "Bog",
                  "The Bog"
               ],
               "secondary_keys": [],
               "content": "The Bog is located in the southwestern part of Maldorr. It is a dense and mostly uninhabited marshland. Many animals and monsters call it home, and a handful of demi-humans dwell there as well.\n\nThings native to The Bog(Alligators + Snakes + Giant Snakes + Undead + Demons + Basilisks + Hobgoblins)\n\nThe bog is also home to a unique creature called Bog Men. Bog Men are strange undead that appear to be made entirely of mud, but underneath it all is a human skeleton. They are extremely durable and completely immune to fire, making them formidable opponents.\n\nThere are two tribes within The Bog, a tribe of Hobgoblins and a tribe of Merfolk. These tribes use to be rivals, but have started working together due to how harsh and unforgiving The Bog has become.\n\nThere is a single Dragon in the bog, a Black Dragon that breathes acid and poison instead of fire.",
