               "keys": [
                  "The Wilds"
               ],
               "secondary_keys": [],
               "content": "The Wilds is in the southeastern part of Maldorr. It is a massive and extremely dense forest that is mostly uncharted by humans. There are no human settlements within the forest, but several demi-human tribes. The trees within The Wilds grow extremely tall and very wide.\n\nCreatures inhabiting The Wilds(Giant Spiders + Kobolds + Drakes + Ogres + Panthers + Dire Panthers + Owlbears + Gnolls + Basilisks + Deer)\n\nThere are several small tribes within the Wilds, including a tribe of Beastfolk, a tribe of Hobgoblins, a tribe of Kobolds, and a tribe of Avians.\n\nThere is a single dragon within The Wilds, a Red Dragon that dwells in a large cave in the far East.",
