               "secondary_keys": [],
               "content": "These creatures can be found anywhere in Maldorr, but they are exceedingly rare.\n\nVampires typically try to blend in with human society, feeding from the shadows to avoid being caught.\n\nWerewolves are completely savage creatures. Once the first transformation happens, it is permanent. They roam the forests and plains at night in search of prey.\n\nDevils are exceedingly rare, and typically only appear to offer deals to mortals in exchange for their souls.\n\nLiches are incredibly rare, and are most likely to be encountered in The Bog or the Deadlands. They are undead capable of wielding magic and are incredibly hard to kill.",
